            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prematurity is linked to risks of developmental disorders later in life. Developmental care aims to improve the comfort of premature babies and to support their physiological, neurological, behavioural and relational skills. Centred on the infant and their parents, it is based on scientific evidence.</AbstractText>
